  "L1-GATE-1: Measure ACTUAL Kendall-tau(input_tokens, realized_decode_length) on real VLM traces (Qwen-VL/LLaVA, perception+reasoning mix). This is the single most load-bearing premise — if real tau is NOT below the simulated tau*, the ecological claim collapses and the result reduces to 'known regime of robustness theory, quantified in a toy model'.",
  "L1-GATE-2: Reproduce FCFS vs input-length-biased scheduling under a continuous-batching simulator (Vidur) or real vLLM/SGLang with iteration-level scheduling. Confirm the p99 regression survives preemption and batching dynamics. If magnitude collapses to <1.2x, the headline is effectively killed.",
