  "L1-GATE-4: sigma_d sensitivity sweep — the 1.4-5.8x magnitude is conditional on sigma_d=1.0 (heavy tail). If it vanishes at sigma_d<=0.5, the result is regime-conditional, which must be stated.",
  "CITATION-GATE: Add Purohit/Svitkina/Kumar (NeurIPS 2018), Lykouris/Vassilvitskii (ICML 2018) — consistency/robustness theory that 'bad-enough predictor => worse than prediction-free baseline' is a KNOWN qualitative regime. Position contribution as quantitative extension + VLM ecology, NOT as discovering the regime. Add Fu 2408.15792 and S3 2306.06000 as works that ALREADY treat input-length as inadequate proxy."
