PRIOR_ART_ADEQUATE: no
RATIONALE: v001. Four yellows, one red. The red (evaluation_prosecutor) raises the strongest objection: the M/G/1 non-preemptive model structurally misrepresents continuous batching, and input-length-SJF may be a strawman nobody deploys. This is partially rebutted — the packet self-declares M/G/1 as an L0 approximation, gates L1 on exactly real-system validation, and the C1 oracle control is informative regardless of queueing model (it proves a correct proxy helps, so the harm is the proxy, not SJF per se). But "partially rebutted" is not "dismissed": the 1.4-5.8x magnitude is INSEPARABLE from the non-preemptive head-of-line blocking that continuous batching mitigates, so the headline number may not transfer. I cannot justify upgrading to GREEN with an unrebutted structural-mismatch concern at the core of the evaluation.

The novelty assessment converges across novelty_killer and theory_skeptic: the mechanism (anti-correlated proxy makes SJF worse than FCFS in heavy-tailed queues) is a KNOWN REGIME of learning-augmented scheduling robustness (Purohit/Lykouris NeurIPS/ICML 2018; Mitzenmacher 1902.00732), and "input-length is a bad proxy" is the assumed motivation of the output-length-prediction subfield (Fu 2408.15792, S3 2306.06000). The genuinely new pieces — (1) the tau* crossover quantification with magnitudes and (2) the VLM ecological claim that realistic mixes sit below tau* — are respectively (1) a quantitative extension of a known qualitative regime and (2) an unmeasured hypothesis (tau imposed via Gaussian copula, not measured on real traces). Neither piece, at L0, reaches the bar for GREEN without the robustness-theory prior art being cited (it is currently absent — prior-art search INADEQUATE on this axis) and without L1 validating the ecological premise.

The product_realist correctly notes the result is defensive (FCFS is already the production default; no evidence of deployed input-length-SJF), which limits operational significance to "avoid a bad optimization" rather than "adopt a better one." This is still valuable IF the ecology holds.

VERDICT LOGIC: Cannot emit GREEN — prior-art search inadequate (Purohit/Lykouris uncited), evaluation_prosecutor RED unrebutted on structural mismatch, ecological premise unmeasured. Cannot emit RED — no verified >=2-source fatal collision, controls are well-designed and informative within their model, the mechanism is real (not fabricated or trivial), and the L0 explicitly gates on L1 for the issues raised. YELLOW with four hard gates for promotion. The L1 that would change this verdict is exactly the one the packet already prescribes: real VLM trace tau measurement + vLLM/SGLang replay + CIs + baselines.
